        "description": {
            "value": "<p>High-speed regeneration. You gain <strong>fast healing 2</strong>. This increases to <strong>fast healing 4</strong> at 11th level and <strong>fast healing 6</strong> at 17th.</p><p>It is <strong>deactivated while you have the dying condition</strong>, and <strong>suppressed until the end of your next turn</strong> whenever you take spirit damage or damage from a holy or vitality effect.</p><hr /><p><em>Soul Reapers and Quincy exist to shut this down, and both can, from 1st level. That clause is the point, not a caveat.</em></p>"
        },
